  "description": "SPEC_21 section 4 canonical schema for pl, Professional Liability (L1 code pl; DECISIONS_2026-10-19 row 48, separate from Errors & Omissions, professional_eo), composing common_model.json 1.1.0 by $ref: the envelope plus the claims_made_terms block. A professional liability declarations prints its insuring agreement's per-claim and aggregate limits (coverages[].limits[]), its retention or deductible (coverages[].deductibles[]), whether defense costs are inside or outside the limits (claims_made_terms.defense_within_limits) and its prior-acts terms (claims_made_terms.retroactive_date, pending_prior_litigation_date, continuity_date) -- all common-model concepts, so there is no LOB block. Built from the professional_eo schema 2.0.0, whose seeds were the source-data pl folder's single-LOB professional liability declarations (Benchmark, Coterie, CNA, Hartford, Nationwide, Travelers), read in place. Draft for the project owner's approval.",
